{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic"],"declarations":31,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.cosimplicial_retraction_level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.cosimplicial_retraction_level","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L180-L185","doc":"Retraction at each level: codegeneracy ∘ coface = id. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.peiffer_central_automatic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.peiffer_central_automatic","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L173-L178","doc":"The Peiffer identity, read off a crossed module: the boundary intertwines\nthe action with conjugation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.cosimplicial_crossed_groupoid_exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.cosimplicial_crossed_groupoid_exists","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L145-L171","doc":"The assignment `[n] ↦ 𝔊ₙ` extends to a cosimplicial crossed groupoid.\n\nThe construction is purely algebraic (§7c): the crossed module at each\nlevel is the central one, `∂` landing in the centre, so the Peiffer\nidentity holds by conjugation-triviality and no archimedean\nspecialisation to `ℝ` is required anywhere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.codegen_codegen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.codegen_codegen","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L139-L139","doc":"Cosimplicial identity: σʲ ∘ σⁱ = σⁱ ∘ σʲ⁺¹ for i ≤ j. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.coface_coface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.coface_coface","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L135-L135","doc":"Cosimplicial identity: δʲ ∘ δⁱ = δⁱ ∘ δʲ⁻¹ for i < j. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.crossedMod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.crossedMod","kind":"def","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L133-L133","doc":"The crossed-module structure at each level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.retraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.retraction","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L130-L130","doc":"Retraction: `σ ∘ δ = id` on levels (from 𝔡_{n+1} ∘ ℓ_n = id). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.codegeneracy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.codegeneracy","kind":"def","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L128-L128","doc":"Codegeneracy map: descent sends level-(n+1) data to level-n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.coface","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.coface","kind":"def","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L126-L126","doc":"Coface map: jet prolongation sends level-n data to level-(n+1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.tripleAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.tripleAt","kind":"def","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L124-L124","doc":"The Yekutieli triple at each level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid.mk","kind":"ctor","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L122-L122","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid","kind":"structure","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L113-L141","doc":"**Cosimplicial crossed groupoid** for the brane tower.\n\nThe recursive brane tower `{Aₙ}` carries a cosimplicial structure:\n- Coface maps `δⁱ : 𝔊ₙ → 𝔊ₙ₊₁` from jet prolongation\n- Codegeneracy maps `σʲ : 𝔊ₙ₊₁ → 𝔊ₙ` from descent\n- Crossed structure from conjugation via Ad(SU_{qₙ}(2))\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid}` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.peiffer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.peiffer","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L102-L102","doc":"Peiffer identity: `∂(g · n) = g · ∂(n) · g⁻¹`.\nAutomatic for central extensions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.action","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L99-L99","doc":"Conjugation action of 1-morphisms on 2-morphisms. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.boundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.boundary","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L97-L97","doc":"The boundary map ∂ : 𝒪_M× → SU_{qₙ}(2), sending a unit to\nits central embedding. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.grpG","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.grpG","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L94-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.grpN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.grpN","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L93-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.G","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L92-L92","doc":"The gauge group `G = SU_{qₙ}(2)` acting on the band. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.N","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L90-L90","doc":"The band `N = 𝒪_M×`, the group in which the 2-morphisms live. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule.mk","kind":"ctor","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L88-L88","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CrossedModule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CrossedModule","kind":"structure","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L80-L103","doc":"A crossed module in the sense of Yekutieli [yekutieli2010]:\na boundary homomorphism `∂ : N → G` and a `G`-action on `N`\nsatisfying the Peiffer identity.\n\nBoth carriers are groups (§7c): `N` models the band of units `𝒪_M×`\nand `G` the gauge group `SU_{qₙ}(2)`. No ring, field or division is\ninvolved — `g⁻¹` is the group inverse. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutielijTriple.twoMorphisms_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutielijTriple.twoMorphisms_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L72-L72","doc":"The 2-morphisms are invertible (they live in 𝒪_M×). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutielijTriple.twoMorphisms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutielijTriple.twoMorphisms","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L70-L70","doc":"2-morphisms: deformation parameters a_{ij} in the band 𝒪_M×. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutielijTriple.oneMorphisms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutielijTriple.oneMorphisms","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L68-L68","doc":"1-morphisms: transition automorphisms g_{ij} in Aut_C(Aₙ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutielijTriple.objects","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutielijTriple.objects","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L66-L66","doc":"Objects: local trivialisations of the Frobenius–Hopf object Aₙ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutielijTriple.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutielijTriple.level","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Level in the brane tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutielijTriple.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutielijTriple.mk","kind":"ctor","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.YekutielijTriple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.YekutielijTriple","kind":"structure","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L58-L72","doc":"A Yekutieli triple at level `n` over a manifold `M`:\nthe datum `(x, g, a)` of local trivialisations, transition\nautomorphisms, and deformation parameters. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_param","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.R_q","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/cosimplicial-crossed-groupoid.lean#L46-L48","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]` (Laurent polynomials over ℤ).\nSee `QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing` for the compiled definition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}